-- The POS store on PostgreSQL — docs/store-on-postgres.md (2026-09-13).
--
-- Owner ask: "Make all the POS screen read the Postgres not Mock." Every table
-- and column below was a browser-only field of apps/web/src/mock/seed.ts,
-- marked ⚠️ there. Generated by `prisma migrate diff`; the grants at the end
-- are hand-written, because the writers are granted per migration by design
-- (20260815060658).
--
-- Enum values added here (SERVIS, TOKOPEDIA, TIKTOK, LAINNYA, BUNDLE, HILANG)
-- cannot be USED in this transaction — PostgreSQL refuses a new enum value in
-- the transaction that created it — so anything that names one, the BUNDLE
-- branch of Discount_type_fields_check above all, is in the next migration.

-- CreateEnum
CREATE TYPE "ReasonActivity" AS ENUM ('ADJUSTMENT', 'RETURN_CUSTOMER', 'RETURN_SUPPLIER');

